window.products.push({"id":711053,"name":"Giant Green Number '4' Balloon Decoration - Party Supplies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IY7MHSDUL._AC_.jpg","description":"All of the balloons are Brand New, some may not be in original packaging but they are new. They are purchased in bulk and the savings is passed on to you! The balloons are as pictured. All the balloons are double sided, the same picture is on the front and back.All my balloons are BRAND NEW deluxe helium quality from the manufacturer. The balloons are not filled, you can fill at your local grocery store, discount store, or florist, or rent a helium tank from your local party store or welding company. You can also air fill it and tape to the wall or attach balloon sticks. If using air, insert a straw carefully into the self sealing opening and blow, then remove and it will seal. Please note that mylar will last about 1-2 weeks, latex will only last about 8-24 hours, so best to inflate those just prior to your party, although actual float time varies. Just be sure to use the correct inflator. A black nozzle tip will be used for latex balloons, and a gold narrow tip should be used for mylar balloons. If you use a larger latex black inflation nozzle on helium balloons, you risk over inflation of the balloon and harming the self sealing properties and this may cause early deflation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IY7MHSDUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grabo","source_asin":"B072XVK41S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072XVK41S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072XVK41S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":711054,"name":"Mauviel Copper 11-7/8-Inch Round Frying Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YAY10D2OL._AC_SL1181_.jpg","description":"Dedicated to gourmands who require only the best kitchen equipment, Mauviel's round copper frying pan is a great multipurpose tool in your kitchen--great for frying, searing, and flambéing. Measuring 11-7/8 inches in diameter, it's constructed of solid copper--the most efficient conductor of heat used in cookware, giving you more precise control over the cooking process. It also features an an 18/10 stainless steel interior for maximum durability as well as enabling the use of metal tools. The stainless steel is bonded to the copper by lamination, prior to production, thereby achieving a uniform layer over the whole pot. It's complemented by a cast stainless steel handle that's riveted to the body of the pan for added durability. Hand washing recommended. Exterior can be cleaned and polished with copper cleanser. Established in 1830 by Ernest Mauviel in Villedieu-les-Poêles, the strength and foundation for Mauviel's manufacturing expertise is based upon the rich 800-year tradition of copper manufacturing this Normandy village known as \"the city of copper.\" Today, Mauviel products are used by many famous chefs and professionals, and its cookware is also designed to meet the needs of the most discerning household cooks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YAY10D2OL._AC_SL1181_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mauviel","source_asin":"B001KZHE6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001KZHE6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001KZHE6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
