window.products.push({"id":711062,"name":"Cider Mill Collection 100% Jute Fiber Rug Stair Tread Runner Floor Cover Area Kitchen Oval Rectangle Braided Striped Farmhouse Style Decor Assorted Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IkW33ToaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Enhance your stairway with the Cider Mill Jute Stair Tread Rectangle Latex. Featuring concentric, mixed braids of burgundy, tan, black, and olive green for a classic country, primitive look. Contains machine stitching that holds the braiding together even with increased wear and tear. Reverses to latex spray backing to prevent slippage.SIZE: The Cider Mill Jute Rectangular Stair Tread with Latex Backing is 8.5 inches wide by 27 inches long with a pile height of approximately 1/4 inch. Stair treads are sold individually.COUNTRY PRIMITIVE DESIGN: Traditional style that compliments any country, rustic, or Americana home. Cider Mill Jute highlights mixed braids of burgundy, natural, black, and olive green in traditional rows of beautifully dyed natural fiber jute.PREMIUM CONSTRUCTION: Our heirloom-quality pieces are built to last for years to come. Our durable 100% jute stair treads are expertly machine braided and machine stitched in India. The use of a non-skid rug pad is recommended (not included). Each stair tread has a latex spray backing.COORDINATES AVAILABLE: Pair this stair tread with pieces from our entire Cider Mill Jute collection for a complete look. Available in rugs and kitchen tabletop items. Or, refresh your home in a simple way that combines well with farmhouse, traditional country, or rustic looks.CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Spot clean only. To prevent colors from bleeding do not use chemicals or wet clean this item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IkW33ToaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VHC Brands","source_asin":"B07DPMCXHF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DPMCXHF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DPMCXHF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":711063,"name":"Classic Brands Advantage Individually Wrapped Coils Innerspring 8-Inch Firm Mattress Includes a 4-Inch Low Profile Instant Foundation, Twin XL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yLYd+ErRL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Classic Brands Advantage Wrapped Coil Innerspring 8-Inch Mattress is constructed with tempered steel coils that improve the mattresses durability and longevity and is an excellent value for supportive, undisturbed sleep for years to come. The 8-inch profile Advantage Innerspring Mattress is the ultimate support of a wrapped steel coil innerspring at the right price. The 8-inch individually wrapped coils are encased in separate pockets, so they can contour precisely to your body. Individually wrapped coil inner springs move independently and reduce the sensation of movement on a bed providing contouring comfort and support for an undisturbed night sleep. Covered with a beautifully detailed quilted knit cover for breathability. Superior Construction The Classic Brands Advantage Innerspring has 8 inches of 768 Count 13 gauge Wrapped Coils. Individually wrapped coils move independently and are in their encased in separate pockets so they can contour precisely to your body. The support base in our hybrid mattresses consists of innerspring individual coils wrapped in a fabric designed to minimize friction and maximize support. The 13-gauge steel coils tend to provide consistent distribution of support throughout the mattress and lessens motion transfer for sleep partners. Get it Right the First Time It is also a good idea to know the size and the height of your mattress ahead of time to make sure you are ordering the correct size. Keep in mind that you should combine the height of your bed frame, foundation, or adjustable bed base with the height of your mattress to get a gauge of the how tall your sleep system will be. Twin Size - 39\" W x 75\" L x 8\" H Twin XL Size - 39\" W x 80\" L x 8\" H Full Size - 54\" W x 75\" L x 8\" H Queen Size – 60\" W x 80\" L x 8\" H King Size – 76\" W x 80\" L x 8\" H California King Size – 72\" W x 84\" L x 8\" H Classic Brands Smart Packaging Smart packaging reduces the carbon footprint in the manufacturers shipping process. Our advanced packaging technology means we can roll-pack our mattresses and ship them at one-third of the normal size. As a result of this process, we can ship more mattresses per delivery and reduce the amount of carbon emissions. A mattress that is roll-packed still retains its initial quality, as each will quickly recover and return to its original shape after coming out of the packaging. Quality Assurance The Classic Brands Advantage Wrapped Coil Innerspring 8-inch mattress is backed with a worry-free 3-year warranty. Look for more innovative specialty sleep products from Classic Brands","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yLYd+ErRL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Brands","source_asin":"B08R6SMSXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R6SMSXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R6SMSXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
