window.products.push({"id":711116,"name":"JUDVX Queen Comforter Set 8 Pieces, Bedding Comforters & Sets Queen Size Pintuck Pink, Bed in A Bag Queen with Comforters, Sheets, Bed Skirt, Pillowca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816sCxSncRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELABORATE DESIGN: REFRESH YOUR ROOM by adding this charming JUDVX bed in a bag! Multiple pinch pleats queen comforter sets create an exquisite diamond-pattern design. Which prevents the fill from shifting or clumping. Try the warm and lofty and pleasantly soft shell of our comforter! BREATHABLE & DURABLE: WARM YOU YEAR-ROUND! Most down-alternative comforters don't breathe well, but when you sleep with the JUDVX CLOUD-LIKE queen comforter set, you will rarely wake up because you are too hot or too cold! You'll enjoy a cozy feel year-round! MADE OF 100% POLYESTER MATERIAL: High-fill-power alternative-down is lightweight and warm, 240 GMS, but not heavy. Our comforter is lofty and so warm to sleep under (without overheating), and it doesn't slide off the bed like some of the other heavier comforters. USER FRIENDLY: WE CARE WHAT YOU CARE! Bonus side pocket-on the side of the bed skirt is a pocket perfect for storing your phone, a book, your glasses, or even the TV remote! Give your master suite or guest bedroom a sophisticated makeover with our bed set! MACHINE WASHABLE: EASY TO CLEAN! Our bed set's polyester construction cleans easily. Machine wash (do not use bleach) and tumble dry on low. No risk of fading and quick to dry, our JUDVX bedding sets are made to stand the test of time! PERFECT GIFT CHOICE: Special gifts for your favorite people! Easpecially it's Mother's Day, Father's Day, or Christmas. Perfect gift (JUDVX comforter set) idea for men and women, boys and girls, kids and teens of all ages! Perhaps that one is you! WHAT INCLUDES: The complete bed-in-a-bag set includes a fluffy poly-fill comforter, flat and fitted sheets, pillowcase(s), pillow sham(s), bed skirt. Multiple styles are available. All pieces of set conveniently complement each other to produce a complete and stylish bedding design! SATISFACTION PRIORITY: If you have any problem with our JUDVX comforter set, rest assured that we will try our best to make it right. We adhere to the business philosophy of customer first, and your confidence, gracefulness and sense of comfort are our greatest success and motivation!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816sCxSncRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"judvx","source_asin":"B09QKZC5F3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QKZC5F3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QKZC5F3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
