window.products.push({"id":711239,"name":"Touching and Heartfelt Poem for Extended Family Members - In-Laws Are Special People Poem on 11 x 14 inches Double Beveled Matting (Black on White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X1qZflNDL._AC_.jpg","description":"For Extended Family Member: Beautiful and Inspiring Poem to tell your loved one how much you love them. Show them your love, give them a gift from the heart. Like a card, a poem can express your feelings, but a poem can be framed and displayed. It's a wonderful gift that will be cherished for years to come. **Caption for entire poem: ** In-Laws Are \"Special\" People, I m So Glad You re Mine! Some people have a way of reaching out And touching the lives of others With warmth and with Love. You are one of those people. For all the warm and loving things You do that are such a part of being \"You\" This comes with thanks and With much love . . . And hope your day is just like you . . . \"Special\" In everyway!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X1qZflNDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poems for Family Members","source_asin":"B07C2VV19X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C2VV19X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C2VV19X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":711240,"name":"Moonluna Red Anchor Nautical Wall Clocks Large Decorative Wooden Quartz Silent Clock 16 Inches Home Clock Gifts for Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UUeM0uMgL._AC_.jpg","description":"Description: Wooden wall clock is made of wooden MDF, wood particle board painted, covered by paper drawing, various designs paper cover on MDF available. Add charm to any room in your home. AA battery is required for this clock (not included). Farm house and vintage wall wooden clock can be a good gift at housewarmings, weddings, and social gatherings. Instruction: 1. There is an instruction in the shipping box, if you have problem with the clock, please fix hands set with the instruction. 2. The clock is not framed, also no glass face as the cover. If hands touch each other, you can adjust the hands to avoid the hands touching. If the hands drop down, don't worry, they are just loose, just press hands tight on the core shaft to make the hands parallel, then the hands will not drop and will keep time. 3. Sometimes the movement is not work just for the wrong place of the second hand. The red second hand is too deep or too shallow will effect the movement. You can pull the red second hand out and then add it again, then clock work well. There are slight difference between the picture and the real item caused by light brightness. Because the batteries is limited by international transport, the battery is no contain, please pay attention.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UUeM0uMgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moonluna","source_asin":"B07K6MZJLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K6MZJLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K6MZJLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":711241,"name":"Aysmart Good Grips Professional 7-inch Santoku Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tUjmUelIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"7-inch Santoku Hollow Ground Knife  Constructed from one piece of high-carbon, stain-resistant, German steel, this knife is individually balanced increasing the comfort, efficiency, and strength. The blade has been hand ground to achieve maximum sharpness and designed with kulles, indentions along the blade edge that are specific to the santoku knife. These reduce the friction and prevent food from clinging to the blade. The ergonomically contoured comfort-grip handle is designed to fit all hands. Aysmart offers a lifetime warranty, recommends washing all knives by hand, and suggests always storing cutlery sets in the appropriate storage location","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tUjmUelIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aysmart","source_asin":"B0176BFI3O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0176BFI3O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0176BFI3O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
