window.products.push({"id":711395,"name":"Pro Glide Bed Risers to Elevate Bed Height, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51isIrWrkiL._AC_SL1093_.jpg","description":"Purpose: Increase Under Bed Height  The GL-10 Pro Bed Glide, at 5.5\" tall (see Dimensions Illustration under Additional Images), is about 3\" taller than standard bed glides. Standard bed glides provide about 7\" in bed height (measured from the floor to the bottom of the bedframe). Thus,when installed the GL-10 will raise the bed to a total of about 10\" in height (measured from the floor to the bottom of the bedframe.). The GL-10 is a cost-effective and safe way to give your bedframe extra height.   Construction and Dimensions  - Manufactured in durable polypropylene plastic. - 5.5\" Tall (provides total bedframe height of about 10\") - Base is 3-1/2\" in diameter for stable, secure support.    Installation  The GL-10 is designed to replace your current glides or casters and will insert into the same location on your bedframe as the old glide / caster.   Special Note on Achieved Height Increase  The height of the GL-10 is 5.5\". However, the total height achieved with the GL-10 is approximately 10\" because the bedframe glide / caster receptacle positions on standard frames provide approximately 4.5\" height.  HPG Ltd. Lifetime Service Policy Our Ltd. Lifetime Policy runs from the original date of purchase and covers the repair of manufacturing defects or replacement of your purchased product. Item must be clean and free of stains or damage. Transportation charges and a Policy Service Fee are the responsibility of the consumer. To email your clear images of the issue go to the Homeplace Group's storefront for our contact information. Then you will receive information on the next steps and/or additional information on this policy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51isIrWrkiL._AC_SL1093_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hospitality Bed","source_asin":"B01AVIRAUS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AVIRAUS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AVIRAUS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
