window.products.push({"id":711410,"name":"Myir JUN Halloween Window Clings, 126PCS Halloween Window Stickers Double-Side Removable and Reusable Halloween Window Decals for Halloween Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mkSA13kQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description:  Name: Halloween Decoration Stickers  Function: Halloween decorations  Number of pieces: 9 sheets with 126pcs  Space: living room, bedroom, commercial space, any smooth surface   How to use:  1. Wipe clean with a semi-dry cloth where you want to stick the decal. make sure there is no dust and grease on the surface.  2. Spray a little water on the surface, water will make them stick better.   3. Peel off the decal and stick it to the place.  4. Use card push down slowly from top to bottom, make the water out.  5. Use clean cloth or tissue to absorb extra water to make sure there is no air bubbles.   Features:  1.These window clings have Double-Side patterns, you can see it when you stick them on the window, no matter indoor or outdoor.  2. Suitable size to fit for windows & other smooth surface.  3. There are many cute halloween-related elements, such as skull,ghost,pumpkin,broom, zombies,vampires, witch, dead tree, castle, bats, nets   Package including:  Halloween Decoration Stickers*1set(9pcs）   Tips:   The stickers are used for windows, mirrors, glass storm doors. As it's static Halloween window clings, no adhesive, stick all by themselves. It cannot be stick to walls, cars, wood door and so on. It can be clung on clean smooth surface like mirrors, windows, and bathtubs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mkSA13kQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chitomars","source_asin":"B08P7P6DYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P7P6DYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P7P6DYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
