window.products.push({"id":711427,"name":"Bed Inclined Mattress Topper 7.5-Inch Incline Foam Support Wedge Pillow with Washable Knitted Cover, Wedge Mattress Elevator for Acid Reflux, Neck & B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":143.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+t-sDoTvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Let Wedge Pillow Inflate 5 Days] The wedge mattress/pillow will arrive rolled up and vacuum-sealed in a relatively small box. It will be deformed and thin when you open. Please open all the zippers immediately and wait for 5 days, then it will be restored to its original thickness and shape! If you want to regain the thickness more quickly, please use a garment steamer, to bring the foam back to its actual height and remove sectional wrinkles from the cover. [Versatile King Wedge Mattress] Foam bed wedge support and positioning pillow that fits across the entire width of a king size bed/mattress. Provides continuous inclined support for your best sleep ever. For a hotel or home, the powerful 3-in-1 feature can be used as a mattress topper or placed underneath the mattress to maintain a 7.5 inch incline slope, also it can also be used as a leg elevation. Helps eliminate nervous tension caused by common head, neck, and shoulder pain. [Improve Your Health] Made with comfortable and supportive memory foam, provides pain relief and comfortable all-night support for allergies, post nasal drip, coughing, breathing problems, migraines, and poor circulation. The wedge mattress pillow relieves pressure points, is ideal for sleepers who suffer from acid reflux, heartburn, allergies, snoring, poor circulation, or back neck and leg problems. [Comfortable and Durable] Made with premium-quality high-density foam. Our wedge foam is free from toxic substances, will not be harsh against your skin and doesn’t get heated, unlike other memory foam mattresses. Our wedge foam not only has breathable lining protection, but also protected with a highly comfortable, removable cover that can be washed and is sure to last for many years of use. [Care Instruction and Services] The wedge mattress is outfitted with a soft, cozy knitted cotton cover. In addition to maintaining a comfortable temperature while you sleep, this cover is removable and machine washable, just wash in cold water and toss in the dryer! MeMoreCool is very confident about the experience of the product. Comfort comes first. If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us, we will find the best solution for every customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+t-sDoTvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MeMoreCool","source_asin":"B0BB2D9LR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB2D9LR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB2D9LR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
