window.products.push({"id":711461,"name":"NOVICA Solitary Duck Wood Sculpture","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rrT1MdjPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA works together with talented artists, artisans, and designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake handmade treasures. Our mantra is to Spread Happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer!About this item: Working with jempinis wood, Kadek Darmini of Bali creates this charming duck sculpture. The beautifully-detailed bird appears alert and curious. The statuette is carved by hand and signed by the artisan.Hand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightlySigned by the artistWood grain and color can vary slightlyAbout our Artist: 'I'm Ni Kadek Darmini. I'm proud of my community, which has conserved Bali's rich culture and tradition. I became a woodcarver after following in my parents' footsteps and learned from my father. My friends were also interested in carving, so we checked out other woodcarvers at work and learned by watching. My masks and wood sculptures are made from crocodile, suar or sono wood. They are carved with unique Balinese motifs and then polished. My goal is to express myself through woodcarving and I hope to help my family.'...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rrT1MdjPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B08PG4388X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PG4388X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PG4388X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
