window.products.push({"id":711539,"name":"Feamadou Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set ,Battery Operated Stainless Steel Mill ,Automatic Pepper Mill with LED Light , One Hand Operation ,Adjus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ptHWlF5YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you feel manual grinder is inconvenient and want an electric grinder instead of manual grinder? Our electric grinder set will solve your problems! WHY choose us? vIt lets you season while you are cooking with just one hand, rather than your previous situation of needing both hands to manually twist the grinder. v It has covers on the bottom so you’re not spilling salt or pepper all over the place. vAdjustable dial lets you choose the perfect grind, from very fine to very coarse. vThe light feature on the bottom gives the ability to see how much salt or pepper in your food. vIt’s easy to use ,looks elegant and adds great look to the table so it’s a better choice as a gift to your families or friends. Caution: 1.Operates on 4 AA sized batteries.For best results we recommend use of alkaline batteries. 2.Always keep it clean and avoid the pepper mill to contact with water or other liquid. 3.Recommend yo keep the base jar 80 Percent full of pepper or salt for smooth functioning. 4.If machine gets stuck during use, gently shake the grinder as at times the peppers may get stuck in the grinder. Specification Product Name: Salt and Pepper Grinder Set Material: Stainless Steel Color: Silver Package included: 1 x Pepper Grinder 1 x Salt Grinder 1 x Using Directions HOW to use? Step 1: Open the top cover to the left and load 4 AA sized batteries in the machine. Step 2:Separate the base and battery case.Fill the bottom with salt or pepper. Step 3: Connect the machine to the base as per the arrows marked and the two metal wires connect with the screw on the base for the functioning of the light. Step 3: Put the top cover on machine and turn right to lock it. Step 4:Choose how fine you need the pepper or salt to be ground with the screw under the base. Turn left for rough grinding and turn right for fine grinding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ptHWlF5YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Feamadou","source_asin":"B08RN2XXSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RN2XXSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RN2XXSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
