window.products.push({"id":711542,"name":"Throw Pillow Insert 26\" x 26\" (2 Pack) Synthetic Down with 100% Cotton Cover Faux Alternative Decorative Form","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516zGHIlmZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"📏 WHAT SIZE TO BUY – The size you buy depends upon your preference of look and feel. If you want the “karate Chop” look, buy an insert that is the same size as your cover. If you want your pillow to be firm and full, buy an insert one size larger (about 2”) than your cover. EXAMPLE: for 18” x 18” COVER, if you want the “Karate Chop” look, get an 18” x 18” INSERT, for a firm pillow get a 20” x 20” INSERT. 🔎 MATERIAL – Our microfiber-filled synthetic down inserts are filled with 100% hypoallergenic white polyester microfiber. They look and feel just like our real goose down feather pillows, but without the feather shafts. This makes for a high quality, plush pillow insert that offers support for your head or back, but at the same time is soft and luxurious for maximum comfort. The microfiber fill is stuffed inside a 255 thread count 100% cotton pillow cover that is down-proof. ✔ QUALITY – These pillow inserts are filled with 100% synthetic down-like microfiber. The down-proof cotton covers help contain all the filling materials so you don’t have fibers leaking out. The micro down filling makes for an unbeatable price, while offering the same luxury feeling of real goose down, with the added bonus of not having to feel any hard feather shafts. ✨ MACHINE WASHABLE – These pillow inserts are machine washable and dryer-safe for your convenience. Wash in lukewarm water (mild detergent or soap, DO NOT USE BLEACH). You can air dry or put in the dryer on low heat. Make sure that these dry completely before re-use. You can put some tennis balls in the dryer to keep the pillows fluffy while drying. You can put the tennis balls inside a dryer bag or socks to lessen the impacts on the inserts during the drying. ℹADDITIONAL INFO – If you want a firm pillow, we suggest buying an insert that is 2” larger than your cover. If you want the “Karate Chop” look, buy an insert that is the same size as your cover. These pillows are made with 100% microfiber fill.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516zGHIlmZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hometex Canada","source_asin":"B07RRYVP6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RRYVP6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RRYVP6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
