window.products.push({"id":711844,"name":"Brentwood Originals Pet Rest Elephant Pillow, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rx3QU4FlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brentwood manufactures the largest selection of decorative pillows available in the industry. We do designer collections, private label, contract and our own Brentwood collection. Virtually any size, shape, fabric and color are available with a variety of fills including conventional polyester fill and down alternative microfiber. Decorative pillows represent the only real \"impulse\" category in the home textiles department for retailers and as such make a great vehicle for the introduction of fashion patterns, colors, fabric and shapes. We are always a strong performer and the easiest and quickest way to make a fresh statement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rx3QU4FlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brentwood Originals","source_asin":"B07GN919RG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GN919RG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GN919RG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":711845,"name":"Kurt Adler 4 Inches Toy Story Buzz Mini Nutcracker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KWLRU4TaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Take the holidays to infinity and beyond with our DisneyToy Story Buzz Lightyear nutcracker from Kurt Adler! Buzz is shown in his iconic white, purple, and green spacesuit, holding two ornaments, one red and one green. \"Buzz\" is written on a gold plaque along the base of the Nutcracker.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KWLRU4TaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kurt S. Adler","source_asin":"B07FF41D3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FF41D3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FF41D3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":711846,"name":"Classic Brands Cool Gel Chill Memory Foam 10-Inch Mattress | CertiPUR-US Certified | Bed-in-a-Box, King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81obcRUKSyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We’ve perfected the latest in memory foam and gel technology with our Classic Brands Cool Gel 2.0 Cool Gel Memory Foam 10-Inch Mattress and added a gorgeous quilted cover so that you can get the best night’s sleep ever. Gel-infused memory foam draws heat away from your body and keeps you comfortable while the high-density memory foam conforms to your body, reducing pressure points in any sleeping position and ultimately prevents tossing and turning. The 10-inch profile mattress is adjustable base friendly and CertiPUR-US certified which means it is natural and resistant.The Classic Brands Cool Gel 2.0 10-Inch Mattress has gel-infused memory foam and is designed for the ultimate in comfort and support. Starting with breathable 2-inch Cool Gel memory foam, this layer disperses body heat and creates a cooler sleeping surface while retaining the pressure-relieving properties of traditional memory foam. The 8-inch support base layer maintains the strength and effectiveness of all three layers. Covered with a beautifully detailed quilted knit top and charcoal-grey knit sides for breathability, the four-way stretch conforms to your body for comfort working with the top layer of gel memory foam to optimize its contouring properties.Benefits of Gel Memory FoamA gel memory foam mattress can support each part of the body evenly and individually. Gel Memory foam slowly and automatically adjusts to your body weight and temperature. In addition to the slow, conforming response, gel memory foam offers complete, luxurious and stress support. Additionally, when you do move in bed, memory foam gently 'fills in' and reshapes itself to your new sleeping posture, cradling every contour of your body.The Latest Gel Memory Foam TechnologyGel Memory Foam is a unique material that infuses gel particles into visco-elastic memory foam, creating a cooler sleeping surface. Gel memory foam is more porous or open than conventional foam meaning the cells are interconnected unlike closed cell foam; thereby is more breathable and comfortable than higher density visco-elastic foam. The open-celled physical structure of our foams is self-ventilating. Air travels throughout the material and dissipates body heat regulating your body temperature. Gel Memory foam is natural and resistant.Why Buy a Cool Gel Memory Foam Mattress?Cool Gel mattresses with gel infused memory foam disperse body heat and create a cooler sleeping surface while retaining the pressure-relieving properties of traditional memory foam. Tossing and turning are dramatically diminished and disrupted sleep patterns are greatly eliminated so you can sleep longer without moving and enjoy the benefits of a deeper, more restful sleep pattern.CertiPUR-US CertifiedClassic Brands gel memory foam mattresses are CertiPUR-US Certified. The CertiPUR-US program is a voluntary testing, analysis and certification program for flexible polyurethane foam used as a cushioning material in home furnishings such as adult mattresses, crib mattresses, upholstered furniture and some accessory comfort products. Certified flexible polyurethane foams have been independently laboratory tested.Get it Right the First TimeIt is also a good idea to know the size and the height of your mattress ahead of time to make sure you are ordering the correct size. Keep in mind that you should combine the height of your bed frame, foundation, or adjustable bed base with the height of your mattress to get a gauge of the how tall your sleep system will be.Twin Size - 39\" W x 75\" LTwin XL Size - 39\" W x 80\" LFull Size - 54\" W x 75\" LQueen Size - 60\" W x 80\" LKing Size - 76\" W x 80\" LCalifornia King Size - 72\" W x 84\" LClassic Brands Smart PackagingClassic Brands also uses Smart Packaging. Smart packaging reduces the carbon footprint in the manufacturers shipping process. Our advanced packaging technology means we can roll-pack our mattresses and ship them at one-third of the normal size. Because of this process, we can ship more mattresses per delivery and reduce the amount of carbon emissions. A mattress that is roll-packed still retains its initial quality, as each will quickly recover and return to its original shape after being removed from its packaging.Quality AssuranceThe Classic Brands Cool Gel Mattress is backed with a 10-year worry-free warranty.Look for more innovative specialty sleep products from Classic Brands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81obcRUKSyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Brands","source_asin":"B083GJ7PSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083GJ7PSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083GJ7PSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
