window.products.push({"id":711880,"name":"Extra Thick Mattress Topper Queen Size, Down Alternative Fill Plush Mattress Pad Protector Cover, Cooling Pillow Top with 8-21Inch Deep Pocket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":240.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fod8281wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Q1: How to wash the down-alternative mattress topper? A1: 1.It‘s machine washable. Machine wash separately in cold water. Tumble dry on low heat or line dry. Do not bleach.  2.IMPORTANT: please use a larger capacity commercial washer/dryer. Otherwise, It will damage the fabric and has no space to fluff the down-alternative mattress pad.  3.Wash the mattress pad cover every 3 months to keep it fluffy and clean. We recommend that you buy two pieces of products for change. Q2: How to fluff up the down-alternative bed mattress topper? A2: 1.Use a larger capacity drier. Larger machines will prevent the fill from compressing during the drying process. 2.Add one or two dryer balls to the dryer to fluff the down. 3.Tumble dry it on a low heat for 20 minutes Q3: What's the difference between the memory foam mattress topper and down-alternative fill mattress topper？ A3: 1. Both of them add an extra layer of cushioning to a bed that’s lost its plumpness. 2.If you are a hot sleeper, I recommend you to choose this down-alternative mattress pad! Because its microfiber fill is soft, cooling to touch and odor-free！ But the memory foam mattress has chemical odor and you will get sweaty hot all night! Besides, it's too bulky to store, transport and clean! 3.If you want a topper with maximum support, this down-alternative mattress pad is unsuitable for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fod8281wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Minoroty","source_asin":"B0C3RBHYP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3RBHYP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3RBHYP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
