window.products.push({"id":711925,"name":"Maverick Baker's Oven Thermometer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UrivaGFKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simply a must-have for the avid baker, the Baker's Oven Thermometer lets you know the constant temperature of your oven throughout the cooking process-measuring from 112 to 572 degrees fahrenheit. The easy-to-read LCD display shows elapsed cooking time, target temperature and constant average of the actual oven temperature. This revolutionary thermometer recalculates and updates this average every 10 seconds, and compares it to the set target temperature. What's more, it alerts you if the temperature swings 15 degrees above or below your target temperature. Measurements are taken by using a probe sensor with oven rack clip and insulated metal wire that psses between the oven door seal back to the unit. With some ovens varying as much as 50 degrees fahrenheit from the set temperature on the dial, you can be assured that your cooking at the correct temperature every time. Additional features include a 20 hour count-up or count-down timer, detachable stand for countertop use, and magnets on the back for stickng to metal surfaces. Includes 1 AAA battery.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UrivaGFKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maverick","source_asin":"B0013JSU0O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0013JSU0O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0013JSU0O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":711926,"name":"Kitchen Island on Wheels Rolling Trolley Cart with Storage Island for Kitchen with Wooden Countertop, Drawer, Towel Rack Kitchen Cart for Dining Room,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ssSy-cwzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kitchen carts to keep your kitchen away from clutter. The design that puts function as the top priority, clean lines, and wooden top are matched together, giving the design a traditional look that the kitchen island can easily integrate into any aesthetics. Whether you want an extra surface to chop up vegetables when preparing meals or need a convenient place to keep all the kitchen accessories at hand, this kitchen island can meet your needs. The island has a wood countertop, providing a convenient extra workspace for your kitchen or dining area. There is a large drawer and 2-layer storage space under the countertop, and a towel holder and spice rack for easy access to tableware and other accessories. With a stable safety mechanism, this kitchen cart with wheels makes cooking more accessible and convenient for your kitchen. With 4 universal wheels, you can quickly move the cart at any time, 2 of which can be locked in place when in use. The kitchen island provides a subtle and spacious storage option, and there are many colors to choose from white, natural, and black. Feature: Adjustable shelves to meet various storage requirements. Double-layer with an adjustable shelf, a drawer, and a spice rack provides ample storage space.  The towel rack can be used as a handle to control the kitchen trolley better. 4 universal wheels, rolling smoothly and moving effortlessly. 2 wheels with brakes to ensure stability, safety and prevent unnecessary movement. Durable MDF materials and wooden countertops are not easy to mold or deform, easy to clean. The simple and classic design perfectly blends with most home decoration styles. Specification: Color: Black Main material: MDF, Wood, PP Iron Wheel Overall dimension: 35.4\"L x 15.6\"W x 35\"H Net weight: 84.4 lbs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ssSy-cwzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artist Unknown","source_asin":"B09M6MSR27","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-711926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M6MSR27","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M6MSR27","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
